1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:02,458
(Raj:)Oh, what did I do?

2
00:00:02,613 --> 00:00:04,423
(Howard:)You made us feel like
we're not trying hard enough.

3
00:00:04,582 --> 00:00:06,492
(Bernadette:)Yeah, we were totally fine
half-assing our marriage

4
00:00:06,651 --> 00:00:08,361
(Bernadette:)till you showed up.

5
00:00:08,519 --> 00:00:11,089
(Raj:)Look, I'm sorry
you're upset with me,

6
00:00:11,255 --> 00:00:12,795
(Raj:)but I just have to say
it's nice to see

7
00:00:12,957 --> 00:00:14,337
(Raj:)the two of you on the same page.

8
00:00:14,492 --> 00:00:15,992
(Howard:)Oh, it does feel good

9
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,610
(Howard:)to have you backing me up for once.

10
00:00:17,762 --> 00:00:19,932
-l back you up all the time!
-That is not--

11
00:00:20,097 --> 00:00:21,547
-He's doing it again!
-What is wrong with you?!

12
00:00:24,035 --> 00:00:25,535
(Leonard:)I can't believe they kicked you out.

13
00:00:25,703 --> 00:00:27,543
(Sheldon:)I can't believe
they're still married.

14
00:00:29,373 --> 00:00:32,723
(Raj:)Oh, no, I forgot Cinnamon's
toothbrush at Howards.

15
00:00:32,877 --> 00:00:35,157
(Raj:)I guess you're sharing
with Daddy again.

16
00:00:40,685 --> 00:00:43,065
(Penny:)Bark once if you need me
to call PETA.

17
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:48,500
(Sheldon:)What's that animal doing
in our apartment?

18
00:00:48,659 --> 00:00:50,799
(Leonard:)Oh, relax, she's in her crate.
She can't get out.

19
00:00:52,663 --> 00:00:54,543
(Sheldon:)Jurassic Park.

20
00:00:55,233 --> 00:00:57,733
(Sheldon:)This day just keeps
getting worse and worse.

21
00:00:57,902 --> 00:00:59,312
(Penny:)You know, if it makes
you feel any better--

22
00:00:59,470 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)-It probably won't.
-You're probably right.

